// src/v4/test/claim/workflow/glob_discovery.dag
// Scope: Consolidation #4553 glob-discovery smoke roster — aggregates distributed
//        BoolWitnessClaim markers co-located in claim corpus modules.
// Status: authoritative smoke-roster replacement for deleted v4_roster_pilot.dag;
//        host transport is scripts/v4-testclaim-smoke-roster.sh.
// Note: impossible_bug BoolWitnessClaim markers (#4618) are NOT in the smoke slice;
//       they join glob_discovered_extended_bool_witness_unified_claims when landed.

